d13_stream: ?"a foreign program's random stream (Python's random.Random(20261001 + path)) can't be held: tally's samples are SHA-256 inversions of the same distributions (L §5.16), so path figures agree with the key within their standard errors, not digit for digit" (py_stream)
  law date 2026-09-30, cut 2026-09-30
